Spec: Invoice Demo Package

Platform: Python 3

Purpose:
  Group invoice demo domain, persistence, and orchestration code.

Structure:
  ./__init__.py: Package exports.
  ./models.py: Invoice entities and total calculation.
  ./models.sdd: Model contract.
  ./repository.py: In-memory repository.
  ./repository.sdd: Repository contract.
  ./service.py: Invoice orchestration service.
  ./service.sdd: Service contract.
  ./cli.py: Minimal user-facing adapter.
  ./cli.sdd: CLI adapter contract.

Owns:
  ./*.py
  ./*.sdd

Can modify:
  ./*.py
  ./*.sdd

Can read:
  ../../app.sdd
  ../../tests/test_service.py
  ../../tests/test_service.sdd

Must:
  Keep package modules independent from external packages.
  Keep domain behavior deterministic.
  Keep command-line parsing separate from service orchestration.

Depends on:
  @invoice_demo.models.Invoice
  @invoice_demo.repository.InvoiceRepository
  @invoice_demo.service.InvoiceService

Done when:
  Package exports expose the domain model, repository, and service.
  Service behavior remains covered by ../../tests/test_service.py.
